window.products.push({"id":369055,"name":"Storage Theory Yogurt Fridge Organizer - Holds up to 4 Wide-Mouth Vegan and Greek Yogurt Cups Each - Peel and Stick Slider Shelf for Small Refrigerato","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71spv47Zv0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NEATLY ORGANIZE YOUR FRIDGE SPACE - Keep your favorite yogurt cups within easy reach with the Storage Theory Yogurt Fridge Organizer set of three. Each refrigerator storage rack saves space on the shelves and makes your yogurt cups more visible for grabbing as a snack or tossing in your lunch box. SIMPLE PEEL AND STICK INSTALLATION - Backed with strong adhesive strips, our yogurt refrigerator organizer is easy to install. Simply clean and dry the area to remove condensation, remove the protective film on the peel and stick strips, then press into place. HOLDS UP TO FOUR YOGURT CONTAINERS - Designed to hold any yogurt container up to 3.75” wide, our yogurt slider organizer allows you to store up to four vegan yogurt cups, keto, and greek yogurts. PLACE ANYWHERE - Our space-saving yogurt organizer for fridge spaces can be placed anywhere in the refrigerator. Peel and stick the sliding yogurt holder on the bottom of a shelf, the unused space on the side walls of the fridge, or even under the door bins. Not happy with your placement? The yogurt organizer is easy to remove and reposition without damaging your refrigerator. MADE IN THE USA - Made with 100% non-toxic, BPA-Free, food-grade material, our Storage Theory Yogurt Fridge Organizer sliders are proudly designed and manufactured in the USA at our facility in Cedar Rapids, Iowa. We believe busy households deserve simplicity in functional products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71spv47Zv0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Storage Theory","source_asin":"B08F9V8WYS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-369055","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F9V8WYS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F9V8WYS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":369056,"name":"G.E.T. 3316-CL Heavy-Duty Shatterproof Plastic Pebbled Tumbler, 16 Ounce, Clear (Set of 12)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714UA5w1eBL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Waikiki pebbled tumbler from G.E.T. adds a sophisticated flare to beverage presentations making it the ideal choice for serving a variety of beverages including soda, iced tea, juice and more. Originally designed for commercial use in restaurants, bars and hotels, this tumbler is designed to last. Featuring thick walls and a heavy base, this tumbler is designed to withstand daily use in a commercial setting making it ideal for busy home kitchens. Made from 100% BPA free plastic, this plastic cup won’t shatter, chip or crack when dropped ideal for use indoors or out. These plastic tumblers are approved for use in residential and commercial dishwashers and certified by the National Sanitation Foundation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714UA5w1eBL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Get","source_asin":"B0BKVZ1H6L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-369056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKVZ1H6L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKVZ1H6L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
