window.products.push({"id":369059,"name":"ENOCH Handbag Storage Organizer Dust Cover Bags for Handbag & Purse, Sturdy PVC Organizer for Wall Shelf & Closet, with Zipper and Handles(M)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KSikkxcQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Clear Storage Bags] The front-&-side-transparent design makes your bags in the closet stick out a mile. See through the clear surface of handbag storage, you can even recognize the slight color variations. Easily know the position of each stored purse will save your time picking bags. The excellent clear material, which is nice looking and super durable, can nicely keep all of your handbags protected throughout the year. This bag organizer storage match for most size of wardrobe or closet. [Fine Workmanship] This is a well-made attractive breathable storage for leather bags. It consists of breathable fabric back cover, sturdy straps and strong zipper. As a hanging purse organizer, it can be easily hung up or stand up on their own to save space. The handbags storage is not too bulky and the handles are a good nylon which lay nicely along the bag. You can use these bags in different ways other than just for handbag. [Perfect Sizes] Good size options.(S: 4*8*12in, M: 7*10*15in, L: 5*11*15in, xl: 7.5*14*17in) The sizes are perfectly fit for all purses. It comes in different sizes and shapes which can mix and match to your own preference. This purse organizer storage helps you separate purses by brand or favorites and easily categorize them. So you can quickly find favorites and go-to purses. It is a great idea to store all handbags. [Keep It Beautifully Organized] The handbag organizer makes your handbags a good display and organization and make your closet looks more upscale. It looks pretty for the fashion style design and goes well with rooms of various decoration styles. They can stand up on closet or hanged on the shelf nicely and keep your room neat. Dust free bags are perfect for storing handbags, purses, scarf, etc. [Great Handbag Dust Bag Protection] Using handbag organizer storage is a good way to keep bags and purses stay new and clean. The handbag storage do a great job of keeping stored purses free of dust, debris and spider silk, and comprehensively preserve your beloved bags. And the handbag storage organizer is easy to clean. You can just wipe it with clean water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KSikkxcQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ENOCH","source_asin":"B09YRWLCL9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-369059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YRWLCL9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YRWLCL9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
