window.products.push({"id":369151,"name":"Atlas Original Natural Wooden Crepe Pan Spreader and Spatula Set for Cooking–5 Piece (3-5-7 inch T-Shape Spreaders-2 Different Shape Turner 11,4-11,8 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XoIVnvmuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Spatula and T-shape spreader are very important tool in the kitchen, whether it is at home or in commercial food establishments. Some people may not realize its importance right away but it is a handy tool that can resolve a lot of kitchen issues. A spatula is sometimes called as a palette knife too. Contrary to other types of knives, this does not have a sharp edge or a blade because it is not designed for cutting or chopping. It is flat, flexible and wide. The tip is also rounded so it could not poke or scratch. Wooden tools don't quickly heat to scalding temperatures, chemically react with acidic foods, or scratch pots and bowls, as their metal counterparts do. They don't melt or leach chemicals or strange tastes into hot foods as plastic does.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XoIVnvmuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09GYJN56N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-369151","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GYJN56N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GYJN56N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
