window.products.push({"id":369189,"name":"Get Well Soon Gift Basket for Moms, Sisters, Daughters & Empowered Women. After Surgery Chemo Care Gift, Thinking of You Post Surgery Healing Gift Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CMeEpGHNL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Fragrance – Aroma Therapy has been used for centuries by cultures all around the world to speed up the healing process. This box includes a beautifully frosted glass Aroma Therapy candle with wood lid and is made with essential lavender oil to help with relaxation and recovery. Protected in a beautifully colored canvas bag that says “good vibes only!” Sleep – Your immune system relies on sleep in order to fight harmful substances, and science has shown that darkness is an essential component to a good night’s sleep. This box includes a soft and cozy sleep mask that is designed to block out bothersome light and makes a great addition to a healthy sleep routine. Warmth - For centuries, heat has been used as a simple yet effective way to manage pain and promote recovery. This box includes a fun pair of cozy socks that say “If you can read this, Please rub my feet” They are not just cute, and fun, they are a great way to warm your feet and boost the healing process. Love – Did you know that love and other positive emotion has been scientifically shown to promote health and healing? This box contains a stunning necklace made from high grade Sterling Silver. It boasts a 16” chain with an infinite loop and loving heart pendant which symbolizes never ending love and wellness. Wearing this necklace every day is a great way to remember how valuable you truly are. Color- Studies have shown that bright colors help with healing, improve moods, and bring enjoyment to daily life. The recovery process can sometimes bring us down. To combat melancholy, we have carefully chosen the colors in this gift set to brighten mood and bring cheer during the healing process.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CMeEpGHNL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SILLY OBSESSIONS","source_asin":"B085X2PG7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-369189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085X2PG7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085X2PG7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
