window.products.push({"id":369238,"name":"Christmas Ornament 2022 Christmas Tree Ornament Decorations, Funny Christmas Ornament The Year We Couldn't Afford Gas Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MRenrEkBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Christmas Ornament for the Year of Energy Shortage 2022: The Energy Shortage 2022 Decorations are designed to commemorate the Year of Energy Shortage 2022, pay attention to the Year of energy shortage with this 2022 family Christmas tree decoration! Let us remember this difficult and hopeful time of the year. Thank God we are still together. Christmas Tree Decorations: Tree decorations ornaments can be used to decorate Christmas trees, garlands or hanging on walls, doors or windows. Whether in the living room, bedroom, indoor or outdoor is a beautiful scenery. Funny Christmas Ornament: The Christmas ornaments have special elements, a Gas Station, and a Santa Claus holding a fuel nozzle and cash, showing that we have gone through soaring gas prices this year. We can use it to celebrate Christmas in 2022, or as a Christmas gift to family and friends to commemorate this extraordinary year. Material : Made of synthetic resin, durable and eco-friendly. Not ordinary fragile ceramic material. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee or Your Money Back: Your satisfaction is our top priority. If you are not satisfied with our Christmas Ornaments, just contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MRenrEkBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laeto Leto","source_asin":"B0BNXRD9KT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-369238","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNXRD9KT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNXRD9KT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":369239,"name":"Joyching Weighted Heavy Comforter King Size 15lb Purple 102x90 inches, Weighted Blankets for Adults All Season","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hC4iIh1+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique But Traditional Size - You can use a regular duvet cover for any size Joyching weighted comforter(blanket), the weighted comforter(blanket)size is same as regular comforter size, and no need to buy a little expensive weighted cover additional. Joyching weighted comforter(blanket) with 8/12 durable loops, fits all covers. More larger size for couple share Different Weight Then Other Weight Blanket - Joyching weighted blankets are lightweight and suitable for everyone who has mild insomnia or tossing and turning during sleep, or falls asleep over more than a quarter of an hour, you don't worry about too heavy, even if the elderly will be comfortable when use too Gentle Massage - Our weighted comforter(blanket) simulates a massage-hand finger pressure and slow strokes. The evenly distributed glass beads provided a gentler pressure stimulation than a massage-hand to relieve tension from your muscles tissues. You can focus on the present moment, which makes falling asleep much easier. You'll never wake up during the middle of the night and feel refreshed in the morning Help You Lose Weight & Increased-Metabolic - Consistent and uninterrupted deep sleeping throughout the night decreases ghrelin while increasing-leptin & Significantly accelerates-the-consumption of excess-body-fat. Joyching weighted blanket will applicate DTP, therefore reducing the impulse to leave the bed in an anxious state. Preventing your legs from scurrying towards the kitchen when you toss and turn and have trouble falling asleep Easy Care - The best way to care for your weighted blanket is use with a regular duvet cover. But if not possible, hand wash only. Hang dry or tumble dry on low heat","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hC4iIh1+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joyching","source_asin":"B09WHFDP65","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-369239","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WHFDP65","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WHFDP65","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
