window.products.push({"id":369326,"name":"Ironing Board Cover and Pad Extra Thick Heavy Duty Padded Multiple Layers Silver Coated Ironing Board Cover, Non Stick Scorch and Stain Resistant Stan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LyCLgI9LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM ECO-FRIENDLY, PURE COTTON, NON-CHEMICAL TOXIC COVER - Breathable non-chemical cotton laminated with superior thick felt and foam. Toxic and unnatural materials can be harmful while ironing at 250 degrees Celsius. You no longer have to worry about your health while ironing with this eco-friendly material. MULTIPLE LAYERS EXTRA THICK PADDING FOR REMARKABLE DURABILITY - Multiple layers heavy duty padding provides exceptional durability to ironing board cover and pad. Top layer is extremely scorch and stain resistant cotton fabric. Thick Padding Layers provides extra heat resistant structure, better steam circulation and flat shape during ironing. NOSE POCKET AND ELASTIC EDGES PROVIDE PERFECT NON-SLIP FIT - Elasticized edges and nose pocket design fits the board perfectly. Slipping and the exposure of the edges will be prevented by this. Providing you to have wrinkle free clothes in a shorter time. This ironing board cover and pad is designed for standard size boards (15x54 inches). IRON FASTER AND BETTER WITH REFLECTIVE HEAT- Silver coated top layer reflects the heat of iron back to the clothes so you achieve perfect and wrinkle free clothes in a fraction of time. It’s like having the iron heat on both sides of your clothing at the same time. It also absorbs less water than regular covers. You’ll notice how our ironing board covers eliminate the creases and annoying folds. GENEROUSLY SIZED AND EASILY TAILORED TO FIT A WIDE RANGE OF BOARDS - The 15 inch x 54 inch cover fits all standard sized ironing boards. It is also designed to fit boards that measure 52 to 54 inch in length and 13 to 15 inch in width. One size does not always fit all! Please measure your board before purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LyCLgI9LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"happhom","source_asin":"B0BNNWZDQQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-369326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNNWZDQQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNNWZDQQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
