window.products.push({"id":369359,"name":"Teabloom Siena Teapot – Premium Borosilicate Glass Teapot with Removable Loose Tea Infuser – Stovetop Safe – Tea for Two – 30 oz. / 900 ml (2-3 Cups)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vr1L90vXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A CLASSIC EVERYDAY TEAPOT. With elegant lines that blend well with any décor, the Siena was designed to be versatile and functional for years of use. Durable yet lightweight, crystal clear borosilicate glass feels wonderful in the hand. Constructed of the highest-quality materials that never lose their brand-new appearance, this is the teapot you’ll use every day. CAPACITY: The Siena’s 30 oz. / 900 ml capacity brews 2-3 cups – just right for two people. Stovetop and dishwasher safe. EXCEPTIONAL QUALITY. The Siena is constructed with highly hygienic, non-porous borosilicate glass that ensures you never taste anything but pure tea – and we’ve added an extra-wide handle and non-drip spout for comfortable pouring. The removable stainless-steel infuser will never rust, corrode, or discolor and is laser-cut to catch the smallest tea leaves. A PERFECT GIFT FOR ALL. With deep-rooted values in craftsmanship, innovation, art and beauty, we blend techniques, stories, people and ideas. Whether you need a gift for friends, newlyweds, graduates, relatives – or yourself! – the Siena is a tasteful choice that shows how much you care. SATISFACTION GUARANTEED. Teabloom is the supplier of choice for five-star hotels worldwide, and manufacturer of the world’s largest selection of glass teapots. Founded on years of experience in the tea business, we are dedicated to customer service and stand behind our products with a full one-year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vr1L90vXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Teabloom","source_asin":"B08B5NYVKN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-369359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B5NYVKN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B5NYVKN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
