window.products.push({"id":369586,"name":"Electric Mason Jar Vacuum Sealer, Vacuum Sealer Can Opener Silicone Hose Connector for Regular Mouth and Wide Mouth Food Cans, Jar Vacuum Sealer with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UnN9zg3mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Steps for usage： 1.Place the lid on the top of the Mason JAR.  2.Press the jar sealer down until it covers the entire jar lid.  3. If you use electric pump:  Place the electric pump accurately on suction hole of the jar sealer and press it tightly.Then turn on the electric pump for 10-15 seconds.  4.If you use FoodSaver sealer machine:  Snap in properly one end of hose to the accessory port of the FoodSaver appliance,then snap in properly the other end of the hose to the suction hole of jar sealer. TIPS for you: 1.Please check the brand and model carefully before purchasing. Our product can only be used with FoodSaver vacuum sealers, not suitable for other brands of vacuum sealers (Note: Not compatible with the following FoodSaver models: FM2000, FM2100, FM2500, FM4800, FM4900, FM580, V50160, VS1130 , VS0100, VS0150, US220, FM1100. 2.Do not overfill the Mason Jars, Keep 1 inch head space.3.Choosing the right sealer, Wide mouth sealer only for wide mouth mason jars.Regular mouth sealer only for regular mouth mason jars . 4.Power usage explanation:When charging, the button will display a red light.Fully charged, the red light will turn blue. 5.Please read the user manual before use. If you have any dissatisfaction or suggestion about our mason jar vacuum sealer or service, please contact us immediately and we will provide you with satisfactory service within 24 hours. Package Included: 1* Wide-mouth sealer, 1* Regular-mouth sealer,  1* Electric vacuum pump 2*Accessory Hose 4* Regular and Wide Mouth Caps 1 * Data cab","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UnN9zg3mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Weiei","source_asin":"B0B9SB4BGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-369586","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9SB4BGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9SB4BGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
