window.products.push({"id":369624,"name":"20 Pcs Preserved Dried Eucalyptus Stems, 17\" Natural Fresh Eucalyptus Branches for Shower, Real Plant for Vase Filler, Dried Flowers Arrangement, Flor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u6IyIWnYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[100% Natural] - Selected from natural high-quality fresh Eucalyptus. There are 20 stems in the package, length is about 16''-17''. The stems are durable and cannot break easily. It is common for natural plants to have leaves of different sizes or some defects. [Fresh and Flexible] - Our preserved Eucalyptus stems are treated with a special process to maintain their fresh appearance and flexibility. Unlike dried Eucalyptus, they retain the natural look and feel of real Eucalyptus leaves. The stems are easy to shape and arrange and remain flexible for extended periods of time. [Eucalyptus Fragrance] - eucalyptus has a unique fragrance similar to menthol. When Eucalyptus bundle in the shower, hot steam releases Eucalyptus oil, which can relax the body and mind, purify the air, relieve pressure, and restore vitality. However, everyone has a different sensitivity to scent, so will have different feelings. The scent of preserved eucalyptus will be much less than fresh eucalyptus, so we can not absolutely guarantee that it will have a strong scent. [Perfect Decoration] - One of the most commonly used plants in flower shops. They look good in any flower arrangement and can last for a long time. They are suitable for wall decoration, bedroom, bathroom, dining room decoration, wedding bouquet and party decoration, and create a warm and comfortable family environment. [Perfect Gift] - These preserved eucalyptus stems make a perfect gift for friends, family, Mom and Dad. Our special preservation technology ensures that they retain their fresh appearance even after being picked. In humid environments, preserved eucalyptus may release a green liquid, which is colored glycerin. This is non-toxic and harmless, so there is no need to worry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u6IyIWnYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oning","source_asin":"B0B7NHDMD8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-369624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7NHDMD8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7NHDMD8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
