window.products.push({"id":369689,"name":"Alessi Anna G Corkscrew Miniature","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r0AKndnFS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Alessi Anna G Corkscrew Miniature designed by Alessandro Mendini, 1994, is an exact replica of the original, moving parts and all. The Anna G. Miniature Corkscrew is part of the Alessi miniature collection, a series of 11 design classics selected from the last sixty years of production. From the \"Bombe\" teapot by Carlo Alessi, 1945 to the \"Mami\" stockpot by Stefano Giovannoni, 1999 choose your favorite or collect them all. Alessi is an Italian company. Its corporate mission is to bring a utopian priority to affordable, high design for the home and office. The Alessi Anna G Corkscrew Miniature is available with the following: Included Features: Made of chrome-plated zamak. Designed by Alessandro Mendini.Shipping: This item usually ships within 24 hours. Dimensions Item: Height 3.9 In.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r0AKndnFS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alessi","source_asin":"B00163TBYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-369689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00163TBYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00163TBYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
