window.products.push({"id":369691,"name":"The Green Garmento 40-Inch Signature 4-in-1 Reusable Bag, Black Night","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613yQv46wJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Now you can finally say no to single-use plastic dry-cleaning bags. The Green Garmento is a 4-in-1 garment bag that helps you organize and green your laundry & dry-cleaning routine. It is the perfect solution for pesky plastic, annoying twist-ties and cluttering paper garment covers. 4-Bags-in-1. Here’s how it works at home your Green Garmento serves as a hanging or standard hamper, on your trip to the drycleaner it functions as a duffel bag, and at pick-up your dry-cleaned clothes will be hanging and protected inside your Green Garmento, without a single-use plastic bag in sight. The Green Garmento is an 4-in-1 laundry, duffel and hanging garment bag created to help eliminate the estimated three hundred million pounds of single-use dry cleaning plastic that annually clog US landfills and waterways, threatening marine and wildlife. Each Green Garmento is recyclable, durable, washable, breathable & water-resistant. They are like grocery bags…but for your clothes! Stylish, practical and affordable, The Green Garmento finally presents a viable alternative to single-use plastic laundry and garment bags. Use The Green Garmento for a cleaner closet and a cleaner planet! Specifications: 48” Black Night 4-in-1 Green Garmento bag: Made from recyclable non-woven polypropylene. Breathable & water-resistant. Side zipper allows easy access to hanging garments. Drawstring closure at bottom. Sturdy loop fits over any hook for use as a hanging hamper. Durable shoulder strap for convenient carrying as a duffel bag. Reinforced handles for compressed carrying. Wide gussets allow cleaned clothes to hang gently at all times. See-through front pocket for dry cleaning ticket or other customer ID. Bags Hold 10-14 garments. Machine washable (short cycle - cold) hang dry quickly. Measures 48\" x 25\" wide x 5\" deep (122 x 63.5 x 13cm). Recommended use: two bags to rotate between home and dry cleaner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613yQv46wJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Green Garmento","source_asin":"B008GP7E1E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-369691","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008GP7E1E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008GP7E1E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
