window.products.push({"id":369911,"name":"Queenz Living Cotton Throw Blankets (King - 90 x 108 Inches, Chocolate) Breathable Thermal Cotton Blanket Ultra Cozy Light Weight Herringbone/Chevron ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81buRJ68ptL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUEENZ LIVING COTTON THROW BLANKET COLLECTION 1. High quality glace cotton yarn is used for weaving these throw blankets 2. Each unit is gone through inspection at all level 3. Processed for anti linting and hence easy wash care Supremely Soft Cozy 100% Cotton Throw Blanket Made of Glace Cotton Yarn which is one of the best quality yarn weaved in state of art machinery. Your bed just isn't complete with sheets alone. You'll need blankets to make it truly cozy. When night-time temperatures take a tumble, reach for a blanket to add an extra layer of cozy warmth to your bed. Cotton blankets hold up well to repeated washing, making them a good choice for those who suffer from allergies. Blankets are available in various plush look designs like Trellis/Lattice, Chevron, in various contemporary colors and shades like Beige, Jungle Green, Chocolate (Dark Brown), Grey, Fresca Blue etc. Just browse through our shelves for exiting collections of blankets and various home décor products, seach for ‘Queenz Living’ All our products are covered under 30 Days Money Back Return Policy. If you are not happy with the product, you can return it within 30 Days for a Full Refund of Item value, No Questions Asked!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81buRJ68ptL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Queenz Living","source_asin":"B073Q9G2TH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-369911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073Q9G2TH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073Q9G2TH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":369912,"name":"Coating-Free Carbon Steel Pan - Durable 11.8 Inch Frying Pan - Pans for Cooking Healthy and Delicious Meals - Carbon Steel Pan with Removable Heat-Res","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EnyRhN5IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The secret of perfect stir-frying lies in the quality of your fry pans! We’ve designed unique black carbon steel pans to preserve the nutritional value and original taste of everything you cook, from scrambled eggs to a perfectly browned steak. What makes it head and shoulder above a typical cast iron, oven safe skillet, stainless steel fry pan, or Asian cookware? No artificial coating (PFAO- and PTFE-free): Carbon steel has natural non-stick properties, unlike a stainless steel frying pan, and has no harmful compounds that can leach into food during cooking. Detachable handle: Our chef pan comes with a removable wooden handle and provides a firm, convenient grip. It’s heat-resistant, which reduces the risk of accidental burns. Detach the handle with a few twists of a screwdriver to make this pan oven-ready and oven-safe skillet. Built to last: The high-quality carbon steel in our pans tolerates intense heat and can be used with complete confidence on the stovetop, in the oven, under the broiler without a wooden handle, and on the grill without fear of damaging the big pan. Versatile and easy to use: The ergonomic design of this blue steel pan makes it incredibly responsive to temperature changes so you can avoid overcooking or under-cooking your dishes. Its light weight makes it easy to maneuver. Thoughtful design: The polished, detachable Acacia wood handle on our carbon steel pan 11.8 inch is easy and comfortable to grip. It is an authentic piece of cookware that will add rustic charm to your kitchen decor. Order this handy carbon steel frying pan now and save $10-30 while you start cooking healthy, tasty meals with ease!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EnyRhN5IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOSUKATA","source_asin":"B08HY2J6TW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-369912","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HY2J6TW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HY2J6TW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
