window.products.push({"id":369920,"name":"Empire Art Direct Wild Horses Stampede Frameless Tempered Glass Panel Graphic Wall Art, 63\" x 24\" x 0.2\", Ready to Hang","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":125.24,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811eG+1MC1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About EADEmpire Art Direct has a long rich history of manufacturing wall art and home furnishings since 1948. At EAD, we are proud to be creating perfect decorative products on the market. Our decorations are over 1, 000 designs, EAD has a variety of wall decorations for all moments in your life. Features Item Name: Empire Art Direct \"Wild Horses Stampede\" Frameless Free Floating Tempered Glass Panel Graphic Wall Art Model Name: Wild Horses Stampede Color: Brown, Black, White Style: Contemporary, Western Material: Tempered Glass Technics: Digital super high resolution HD printing is manufactured on the reverse side of the ultra white glass. Featuring Crystallus ultra white tempered glass that is designed to enhance depth and colors unlike conventional commercial glass. This frameless, free-floating, reverse printed, tempered art glass decor can be hung on any wall horizontally. Actual prints colors may be slightly different from pictures shown online due to different monitors. Packing: Packing with Styrofoam in every side and protective corners in carton Product Size & Weight: 63 in. x 24 in. x 0. 2 in. & 22 lbs Package Size & Weight: 65. 6 in. x 27. 2 in. x 2 in. & 26. 9 lbs Decoration Bringing to mind images of the old west, this image of stampeding horses in a desert landscape takes the viewer back to a time when horses were a part of everyday life. Long used for transportation and ranch work, horses were once as important as vehicles are today. There are still small herds of free-roaming North American Mustangs descended from horses brought over by Europeans over 400 years ago. This incredible piece of art will complete the look of any Western motif. About returns policy and our services If you are not satisfied with our product or order wrong item, please let us know immediately, we will offer you the best services. Check out Empire Art Direct for more choices! ORDER NOW! DON'T MISS OUT, LIMITED STOCK!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811eG+1MC1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Empire Art Direct","source_asin":"B005LK0C02","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-369920","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005LK0C02","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005LK0C02","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
